# The TanStack Router plugin regenerates this file with LF endings whenever the
# dev server is running. With core.autocrlf=true git checked it out as CRLF, the
# plugin immediately rewrote it as LF, and git was then stuck reporting a
# modification that blocked checkout, pull, merge, and cherry-pick.
# Pinning it to LF in both the repo and the worktree ends the tug-of-war.
src/routeTree.gen.ts text eol=lf
